        "detailed_description": "<ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a world and explore over 2000+ unique rooms/areas/stages/levels/challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Enter a dark fantasy nightmare adventure game. Spanning a vast, unpredictable dreamscape, in search of answering perplexing questions while gaining abilities and power ups along the way.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transfer  between dark and light worlds in this seemingly endless mind scene.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/8beaa2855c73382bc0953f8d07819ee7.avif?t=1787620079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/8beaa2855c73382bc0953f8d07819ee7.avif?t=1787620079 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play through a merging and dissociating between mirroring dream worlds, desolate nightmares, illusory happy dreams, hidden horrors and joyful goodness in this massive interconnected adventure game.<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/a3e31b8c2274606a63ebaf9cc40fe72f.avif?t=1787620079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/a3e31b8c2274606a63ebaf9cc40fe72f.avif?t=1787620079 width=1560 height=454 /></span> </p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a large variety of top-down environments populated with interactable NPCs Characters and participate in various optional and necessary quests.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/08545fbe2160f5fc95ebabc69db721fc.avif?t=1787620079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/08545fbe2160f5fc95ebabc69db721fc.avif?t=1787620079 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fend off enemy fiends in this top-Down exploration merged with 2D platforming exploration in this large scale adventure game.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/95e8f80484b0802548527c72f4854570.avif?t=1787620079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/95e8f80484b0802548527c72f4854570.avif?t=1787620079 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse a large variety of platforming landscapes.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Switch between overlapping mirror worlds in real time after collecting the mirror item. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a large variety of optional and necessary puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find a multitude of optional hidden secrets, hidden side-quests and hidden collectables</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20+ bosses<br> 50+ different enemy types<br>15+ NPC types<br>450+ collectable items and abilities to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > and so much more hidden features and secrets beckoning to be found</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras/d0c588a4c90c58e5238a22d7c78eaa00.avif?t=1787620079\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2903580/extras_big/d0c588a4c90c58e5238a22d7c78eaa00.avif?t=1787620079 width=1560 height=454 /></span></p></li></ul>",
